Error [jet.UnknownName]: `total` is a local of this file's top-level statements, which a function can't see
  --> tests/ui/script_local_unseen_by_function.jet:6:34
    |
  6 | report: fn() -> String { "total {total}" }
    |                                  ^^^^^
 Why: A file's top-level statements are its entry, and the names they bind are that entry's locals
 Fix: Pass `total` as a parameter
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0107
